# Impeccable installs a full copy of its skill tree into every detected harness
# (~3.4M each). They are vendor artifacts reproducible from the devDependency
# with `npx impeccable install`, so the dependency is tracked and the copies are not.
# Agent-skill installs. The higgsfield skills are symlinks into .agents/, which
# is itself ignored, so tracking them shipped dangling links to anyone cloning.
# Both trees are reproducible: `npx impeccable install` and
# `npx skills add higgsfield-ai/skills`.
.claude/skills/
.claude/hooks/*
!.claude/hooks/session-start.sh
.claude/commands/impeccable*
.codex/
.github/skills/
.github/agents/
.github/hooks/
.grok/
